###   ls /mnt/zl1-ro/system/lib | grep -i qsee      -> (nothing)
###   find .../2026-06-07-adb-root-staged -name '*QSEECom*'  -> the lib64 copy only
###   grep -rl QSEEComAPI over  -- see the referencer lines below
###
### AND: the same-day capture in 2026-06-07-adb-root-exact passes its own SHA256SUMS (31/31 OK)
